{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped in a cursed, abandoned building where every shadow hides danger, and every sound could cost you your life. Slendrina is watching you... and she changes with your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this cooperative horror survival game for 1\u20134 players, you must search for a way to escape, solve deadly puzzles, and hide from the relentless spirit. But remember: every time, Slendrina behaves differently \u2014 be ready for the unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/Atmosphere.png?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dim flashlight beams, creaking floorboards, and breathing behind your back will create tension that won't let go until the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/EscapeRoutes.png?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find hidden paths and explore dark corridors. Your strategy and attentiveness will determine whether you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/AdaptiveSlendrina.png?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She is unpredictable. Sometimes she waits, sometimes she strikes without warning. Every session brings a new threat you can't prepare for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/gif5.gif?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/DynamicMissons.png?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every playthrough introduces new tasks and unexpected changes. What once seemed familiar now becomes dangerous and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you outsmart Slendrina, or will you remain trapped forever?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344520?t=1745046979","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344520?t=1745046979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/d620eedf0a666b5ec94b70483aab11ba65159625/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745046979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/d620eedf0a666b5ec94b70483aab11ba65159625/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745046979","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped in a cursed, abandoned building where every shadow hides danger, and every sound could cost you your life. Slendrina is watching you... and she changes with your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this cooperative horror survival game for 1\u20134 players, you must search for a way to escape, solve deadly puzzles, and hide from the relentless spirit. But remember: every time, Slendrina behaves differently \u2014 be ready for the unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/Atmosphere.png?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dim flashlight beams, creaking floorboards, and breathing behind your back will create tension that won't let go until the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/EscapeRoutes.png?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find hidden paths and explore dark corridors. Your strategy and attentiveness will determine whether you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/AdaptiveSlendrina.png?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She is unpredictable. Sometimes she waits, sometimes she strikes without warning. Every session brings a new threat you can't prepare for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/gif5.gif?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/DynamicMissons.png?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every playthrough introduces new tasks and unexpected changes. What once seemed familiar now becomes dangerous and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1745046979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you outsmart Slendrina, or will you remain trapped forever?</p>","developers":["VortexTeam"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/1b9d0c2627095b38e3cd3f4d3f3a1a36c1c3d502/header.jpg?t=1745046979","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Slendrina: Escape Together","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 470 with 4GB VRAM \uff0f NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 with 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 \uff0f Intel Core i7 8700<br></li><li><strong>Memory